  "title": "Scallop Scampi",
  "description": "Tender bay scallops are cooked quickly in a tasty sauce of garlic, onion, white wine, chicken broth and Romano cheese. Toss fresh green parsley into the mix and pour over cooked linguine. Serve with a sprinkling of Romano cheese.",
  "authors": [
